OL,3,GNEWSATrust has let school down, says
OL,4,AOfsted
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfsted has told an education trust
OL,7,Fwhich runs a secondary school
OL,8,Fpreviously rated "inadequate" it "let
OL,9,Fthe school down".
OL,11,FA monitoring inspection of West Lakes
OL,12,FAcademy, in Egremont, Cumbria, found
OL,13,F"significant further work" was needed
OL,14,Fby leaders to remove its special
OL,15,Fmeasures classification.
OL,17,FThe inspector criticised the Changing
OL,18,FLives Learning Trust (CLLT) for failing
OL,19,Fto provide "meaningful support" to
OL,20,Fstaff and making financial decisions
OL,21,Fwhich meant the school was unable to
OL,22,Fhire teachers to fill vacancies.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
